# Build marker, not the script. scripts/materialize-role-scripts.sh copies the source named
# below to files/Set-RemoteManagementPolicy.ps1 before the role is linted or run; that copy is a
# build artifact the .gitignore deliberately never allowlists.
#
# The script is developed, reviewed and pair-tested once under scripts/, beside its
# Set-RemoteManagementPolicy.pester.ps1 spec. It exists because no module writes a GPO's
# registry policy, firewall rules, security template and link together, and because the
# security template has no cmdlet at all: user rights are written by hand into SYSVOL, the
# Security extension is registered on the GPO, and the machine version is bumped so clients
# reapply -- each step compared before it is written.
scripts/Set-RemoteManagementPolicy.ps1
